# Dictionary generation pipeline (WL-102/WL-105).
#
# Ignored: the ESDB source checkout + build (~150MB) and the intermediate
# JSON (~36MB), both reproducible via `npm run dictionary:generate`.
#
# NOT ignored: src/assets/dictionary/dictionary.pack.json (~1.7MB), the
# packed asset the app actually imports. Metro needs it to bundle, so a
# fresh checkout and CI's native build jobs must have it without running
# the generator (which needs Python, SQLite and a network fetch).
.cache/
src/assets/dictionary/dictionary.json
src/assets/dictionary/manifest.json